From: Brandon Williams <turbine.bmw@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] apps_std: support persistent Qualcomm sensor registries

Allow the sensor DSP to create and update its persistent registry inside the
existing virtual filesystem sandbox. Implement the reverse-RPC file methods
used by registry generation, extended QAIC method dispatch, and larger input
messages needed while parsing sensor configuration.

Writes, removal, and rename remain restricted to the sensor registry and its
three generator metadata files.

Signed-off-by: Brandon Williams <turbine.bmw@gmail.com>
---
